{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36930","headline":"送前南昌崔令替任映摄新城县 · 罗隐","name":"送前南昌崔令替任映摄新城县","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五年苛政甚虫螟，深喜夫君已戴星。\n大族不唯专礼乐，上才终是惜生灵。\n亦知单父琴犹在，莫厌东归酒未醒。\n二月春风何处好，亚夫营畔柳青青。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}